# Succumb to the Cold with one target ("one or two" allows one): the lone Ornithopter an opponent controls is tapped and stunned; a
# second Succumb on the same, already tapped, creature still puts its counter on (CR 701.26a: tapping an already tapped permanent
# does nothing, but the counter is put on all the same), so it holds two stun counters. With no creature an opponent controls the
# spell is not offered (its minimum is one target).

